# ============================================================
#  .prettierignore — files Prettier must never reformat
# ============================================================
#  Same syntax as .gitignore. Prettier 3 ALSO skips everything
#  in .gitignore (_site/, _temp/, node_modules/ …), so those
#  don't need repeating here.

# Nunjucks templates. Prettier has no Nunjucks parser, and many of
# our .njk files aren't HTML at all (htaccess.njk = Apache config,
# robots.njk, sitemap.njk, security.txt.njk, site.webmanifest.njk).
# Forcing the HTML parser on them (as an old .prettierrc override
# did) collapses Apache directives onto one line — Apache then
# answers EVERY request with 500 — and flattens robots.txt and the
# hand-formatted teaching comments. If you want .njk formatting
# later, try a Nunjucks/Jinja-aware plugin on a branch first.
*.njk

# Kept exactly as delivered: design exports, third-party reference
# docs, and archived snapshots of old code.
docs/design/
docs/reference/
archive/
